    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE akumlamula Yoswa kuti ajigale cilambo cicasigele",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pandaŵi jelejo ŵaliji ali acekulwipe mnope. AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵatite kwa jwalakwe, “M'mwe mcekulwipe mnope, nambo cilambo cisigelepe cakuti msumule: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upande wesope wa Filisitiya ni Geshuli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yalumo soni upande wosope wa Afimu kum'mwela. (Cilambo cakutyocela ku Lusulo lwa Siho, ku malile ga Iguputo, mpaka kumpoto ku malile ga Ekiloni, caŵalanjidwaga ca Kenani; ayimwene ŵa Afilisiti ŵatamaga ku Gasa, Ashidodi, Ashikeloni, Giti, ni Ekiloni). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pana soni cilambo ca Akenani, ni Meala (cicaliji ca Asidoni), mpaka ku Afeki, ku malile ga Aamoli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cilambo ca Agebala; Lebanoni josope kungopoko lyuŵa, kutyocela ku Baala Gadi, kukuli kum'mwela kwa Litumbi lya Helimoni, mpaka ku Mpata wa Hamati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cele cilambo cakuti mcipundeci cikupwatikanya upande wosope wa Asidoni, ŵakutama ku cilambo ca kwitumbi pasikati pa Matumbi ga Lebanoni ni Misilefoti Mayimu. Une tinjatoposya pakwakoposya ŵele ŵandu wosopeŵa pitiŵaŵandicileje ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli. M'mwe mkusosekwa kucigaŵa cilamboco mwa ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli, mpela munamlamulile m'mwejo kuti mtende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.33.54"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 33:54",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo sambano, gaŵani aci cilamboci mwa mitundu jine msano ni mcecejo ni litika lya lukosyo lwa Manase, kuti ciŵe cawocawope.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gaŵanya kwa upande wa kungopoko lyuŵa kwa Lusulo lwa Yolodani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mitundu ja Lubeni ni Gadi ni litika line lya lukosyo lwa Manase ŵaliji ali apocele cilambo ciŵapele jemanjajo Mose,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwakutumicila jwa AMBUJE; cicaliji mbali ja kungopoko lyuŵa kwa Lusulo lwa Yolodani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.32.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 32:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Det 3:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Upande wawo wajendelecele ku Aloeli (pa ngulugulu pa Ciŵata ca Alinoni) ni msinda wa pasikati pa cele ciŵataco ni kuwanganya cawe cosope kutyocela ku tawuni ja Medeba mpaka ku msinda wa Diboni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Upande wawo wajendelecele mpaka kungopoko lyuŵa kwa malile ga Aamoni. Upandewo wapwatice soni misinda josope jiŵalamulilaga Mwenye Sihoni, jwa Aamoli, kutyocela ku msinda wa Heshiboni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Upandewo wapwatice soni Giliyadi, yigawo ya Geshuli ni Maaka, litumbi lyosope lya Helimoni, ni Bashani josope mpaka ku Saleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Japwatice ucimwene wa Ogi, jwakusigala jwa Lefayimu, juŵalamulile ku Ashitaloti ni Edileyi. Mose ŵaliji ali ŵapundile ŵanduŵa ni kwakoposya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo, Aisalaeli nganiŵatoposya ŵandu ŵa Geshuli ni Maakati; jemanjajo ali mkutamape mu Isalaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose nginapeleka cilambo ku lukosyo lwa Lefi. Mpela muŵaŵecetele AMBUJE kwa Mose, jemanjajo ŵaliji ŵamti apoceleje yakwagaŵila ya mbopesi syakutinisya pa malo gakupelecela mbopesi yakupelecedwa kwa AMBUJE Mlungu ŵa Isalaeli mpela cipanje cawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.18.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Det 18:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Upande uŵapelece Mose ku lukosyo lwa Lubeni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose ŵaliji ali apelece kambali ka cilambo kwa maŵasa ga lukosyo lwa Lubeni mpela kawokawope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Upande wawo wajendelecele mpaka ku Aloeli (pa mbali pa Ciŵata ca Alinoni) ni msinda wa pasikati pa cele ciŵataco ni japwatice cituluka cosope kusyungulila Medeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Japwatice Heshiboni ni misinda josope pa citulukapo: Diboni, Bamoti Baala, Beti Baalameyoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahasi, Kedemoti, Mefati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiliyataimu, Sibima, Seleti Sahala petumbi lya ciŵataco, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beti Piyoli, mwiŵanda mwa Litumbi lya Pisiga, ni Beti Yeshimoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Japwatice misinda josope ja mcituluka ni ucimwene wosope wa mcimwene Sihoni jwa Aamoli, juŵalamulilaga ku Heshiboni. Mose ŵampundile jwalakwejo, yalumo soni ni ayimwene ŵa Midiyani: Efi, Lekemu, Suli, Huli ni Leba. Wosope ŵaŵalamulilaga cilambo m'malo mwa Mwenye Sihoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwa ŵele ŵiŵawulajidwe ni ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵaliji Balamu mwanace jwamlume jwa Bewoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yolodani galiji malile ga lukosyo lwa Lubeni kungapilo lyuŵa. Aji jaliji misinda ni misi jiŵapelece ku maŵasa ga lukosyo lwa Lubeni mpela jawojawope.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Upande uŵapelece Mose ku lukosyo lwa Gadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
